## https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/blob/main/docs/keybindings.md
Press `?` or `C-K` in the player to see all keybindings.

cliamp (Navigation)
cliamp (EQ and Appearance)
cliamp (Features)
cliamp (Playlist and Queue)
cliamp (Provider browser (`N` key))
cliamp (Provider playlist list)
cliamp (Search results overlays)
cliamp (General)
cliamp: (Playback) Play/Pause | Spc
cliamp: (Playback) Stop | s
cliamp: (Playback) Previous/Next track | </> / ,/.
cliamp: (Playback) Seek -/+5s | Lt/Rt
cliamp: (Playback) Seek -/+30s (configurable) | S-Lt/Rt
cliamp: (Playback) Seek to N×10% of the track (e.g. `7j` jumps to 70%, `0j` to the start) | $j
cliamp: (Playback) Volume up/down | + -
cliamp: (Playback) Speed up/down (±0.25x) | ] [
cliamp: (Playback) Toggle mono | m
cliamp: (Playback) Jump to time | C-J
Toggle focus (Playlist / EQ) | Tab
Playlist scroll / EQ band adjust (wraps around) | j k / Up Dn
Scroll playlist/file browser by page | PgUp PgDn / C-U C-D
Go to top/end of playlist/file browser | Home End / g G
Move track up/down in playlist/queue | S-Up S-Dn
EQ cursor left/right | h l
Play selected track | Etr
Search playlist | /
Expand/collapse playlist | C-X
Open file browser | o
Back to provider | b Esc
Cycle EQ preset | e
Choose theme | t
Cycle visualizer | v
Full screen visualizer | V
Toggle album headers | C-H
Toggle bookmark ★ on selected track (or favorite radio station in radio browser) | f
Search — active provider's native search (Spotify, Navidrome, Jellyfin, Emby, Plex, NetEase, Local) or YouTube fallback. Available from playlist and provider-browser views. | C-F
Load URL (stream/playlist) | u
Show lyrics | y
Save track to ~/Music | C-S
Navidrome browser | N
Browse local playlists (with cliamp radio) | L
Open radio provider | R
Open Spotify provider | S
Open Plex provider | P
Open Jellyfin provider | J
Open Emby provider | E
Open YouTube provider | Y
Open SoundCloud provider | C
Open NetEase provider | M
Toggle queue (play next) | a
Queue manager | A
Remove the highlighted track from the current playlist | x
Playlist manager | p
Cycle repeat (Off / All / One) | r
Toggle shuffle | z
Move cursor | ↑ ↓ / j k
Filter (incremental); `Esc` clears | /
List screen: open the highlighted playlist · Tracks screen: play the **highlighted** track | Etr / →
Tracks screen: play all from the top | P
Add the now-playing track (footer shows which track) | a
List: delete playlist (confirms) · Tracks: remove the highlighted track | d
Tracks screen: go back to the list | ← Bksp h
Close the playlist manager | p Esc
Move cursor (wraps top↔bottom) | ↑ ↓ / j k
Back / drill in | ← → / h l
Filter the visible list (search bar appears under the title) | /
Open (artists/albums) · play the highlighted track and queue the rest of the visible list | Etr
Replace the queue with all visible tracks (start from the top) | R
Append all visible tracks to the queue | a
Queue the highlighted track to play next | q
Cycle album sort (album list only) | s
Quick-switch to that provider without going back through the main pane | S N P J E Y C M L R
Walk back one level / close the browser | Esc b
Move cursor (wraps) | ↑ ↓ / j k
Load the highlighted playlist's tracks into the queue | Etr
Filter the playlist list | /
Online/server search (Spotify/Navidrome/NetEase/etc.'s own search) | C-F
Refresh — re-pull the playlist list from the provider | C-R
Switch to that provider | S N P J E Y C M L R
Switch focus to EQ | Tab
Back to the playlist pane | Esc b
Move cursor | ↑ ↓ / j k
Play the selected track now | Etr
Append the selected track to the playlist | a
Queue the selected track to play next | q
(Spotify only) Save the selected track to a Spotify playlist | p
Back to the search input | Esc Bksp
Show keymap | ? / C-K
Quit | q